%% End-to-end media request flow
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Seerr as Jellyseerr (108)
    participant Sonarr as Sonarr/Radarr (107/106)
    participant Prowlarr as Prowlarr (105)
    participant Flare as FlareSolverr (109)
    participant QB as qBittorrent (103)
    participant Disk as /mnt/data
    participant JF as Jellyfin (104)

    User->>Seerr: Request "Show X"
    Seerr->>Sonarr: API: add series
    Sonarr->>Prowlarr: search indexers
    Prowlarr->>Flare: bypass Cloudflare-protected indexer
    Flare-->>Prowlarr: cleared response
    Prowlarr-->>Sonarr: best release
    Sonarr->>QB: send .torrent
    QB->>Disk: write to /downloads
    QB-->>Sonarr: complete
    Sonarr->>Disk: hardlink → jellyfin/media/Show X
    JF->>Disk: scan + index (Quick Sync)
    User->>JF: stream
